message: "If you reference this specification, please cite it as below."
title: "Grounded RAG — v1 Architecture Specification"
abstract: >-
  The v1 architecture specification for Matryoshka, an evidence-grounded
  retrieval-and-answer system that returns answers grounded in cited evidence
  or declines to answer. A design-phase document set: constitution, proposal,
  scope, architecture decision records, research synthesis, and whitepapers.
